WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.500
Your son... understands.

00:07.960 --> 00:14.500
Good. This Chu Huan is a man of staunch loyalty. Before his departure, go visit him one last time.

00:19.400 --> 00:20.500
As Father commands.

00:36.240 --> 00:42.500
Your Highness, you have come. Before embarking on this path, I knew my head might roll;

00:42.500 --> 00:49.000
I only never imagined that in the end, I would nearly drag Your Highness down into ruin with me.

00:49.000 --> 00:54.000
Chu Huan... the order was mine. You followed me all the way from the north...

00:54.000 --> 01:03.000
When this subject first entered Your Highness's service, it was merely for an imperial stipend. When I fled south with Your Highness, it was out of fear for my own survival.

01:03.000 --> 01:14.000
Yet seeing Your Highness refuse to drown in southern luxuries, laboring relentlessly for our lost homeland... this subject knew he had found a sovereign worthy of dying for!
